os","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neodevils/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neodevils/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-12T16:32:10Z","updated_at":"2025-07-12T16:32:35Z","body":"> it seems that if i export a shape instead of a sprite it renders correctly?\n\nYes, because it doesn’t contain `<use>` which I have already issued in the main post.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3065837549/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3066998670","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108348#issuecomment-3066998670","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108348","id":3066998670,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62zq-O","user":{"login":"dbampersand","id":49893752,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5ODkzNzUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49893752?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbampersand","html_url":"https://github.com/dbampersand","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbampersand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbampersand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbampersand/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbampersand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbampersand/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbampersand/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbampersand/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbampersand/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbampersand/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-13T11:49:08Z","updated_at":"2025-07-13T11:49:08Z","body":"This is an issue with ThorVG which Godot uses to render svgs. Per docs: \n\n> SVG (.svg) - SVGs are rasterized using [ThorVG](https://www.thorvg.org/) when importing them. [Support is limited](https://www.thorvg.org/about#:~:text=among%20the%20svg%20tiny%20specs%2C%20yet%20unsupported%20features%20in%20the%20thorvg%20are%20the%20following); complex vectors may not render correctly. [Text must be converted to paths](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.html#doc-importing-images-svg-text); otherwise, it won't appear in the rasterized image. You can check whether ThorVG can render a certain vector correctly using its [web-based viewer](https://www.thorvg.org/viewer). For complex vectors, rendering them to PNGs using [Inkscape](https://inkscape.org/) is often a better solution. This can be automated thanks to its [command-line interface](https://wiki.inkscape.org/wiki/index.php/Using_the_Command_Line#Export_files).\n\nThe svg you linked doesn't load in the ThorVG Viewer, so you could try creating an issue in their [repo](https://github.com/thorvg/thorvg)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3066998670/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3067115658","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108348#issuecomment-3067115658","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108348","id":3067115658,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc620HiK","user":{"login":"Neodevils","id":71941576,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxOTQxNTc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71941576?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neodevils","html_url":"https://github.com/Neodevils","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neodevils/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neodevils/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neodevils/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neodevils/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neodevils/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neodevils/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neodevils/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neodevils/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Neodevils/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-13T15:33:00Z","updated_at":"2025-07-13T15:33:00Z","body":"> This is an issue with ThorVG which Godot uses to render svgs. Per docs:\n> \n> > SVG (.svg) - SVGs are rasterized using [ThorVG](https://www.thorvg.org/) when importing them. [Support is limited](https://www.thorvg.org/about#:~:text=among%20the%20svg%20tiny%20specs%2C%20yet%20unsupported%20features%20in%20the%20thorvg%20are%20the%20following); complex vectors may not render correctly. [Text must be converted to paths](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.html#doc-importing-images-svg-text); otherwise, it won't appear in the rasterized image. You can check whether ThorVG can render a certain vector correctly using its [web-based viewer](https://www.thorvg.org/viewer). For complex vectors, rendering them to PNGs using [Inkscape](https://inkscape.org/) is often a better solution. This can be automated thanks to its [command-line interface](https://wiki.inkscape.org/wiki/index.php/Using_the_Command_Line#Export_files).\n> \n> The svg you linked doesn't load in the ThorVG Viewer, so you could try creating an issue in their [repo](https://github.com/thorvg/thorvg)\n\nThanks, I have created the issue on [there too](https://github.com/thorvg/thorvg/issues/3615)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3067115658/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]